  "body": "As suggested by @annevk, I'm opening up an issue to make folks aware that I have proposed a `no-console-log` directive as part of CSP3. This is intended as a way for sites to reduce the amount of CSP error logging that can happen when a significant number of resources are blocked:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/w3c/webappsec-csp/issues/217",
